      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `CoroutineScope` passed to `block` is not the one that is given in `scope` argument, this `CoroutineScope` directly comes from the [withTimeout](https://kotlinlang.org/api/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines/with-timeout.html) function.\n\nBy [looking at the source of withTimeout](https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines/blob/d88a8c227a295f91251960c8fe6b21a02ddf704b/kotlinx-coroutines-core/common/src/Timeout.kt#L44) this scope is created for the `withTimeout` call.\n\nI\u0027m not sure why however, but since this comes directly from the signature and implementation of `withTimeout`, I was thinking that it applies to us as well.",
      "parentUuid": "4b9518e1_f74fa27c",
      "revId": "7bdb42a6338404631bb9766212a075786c68ebab",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
