      "writtenOn": "2022-09-06T16:55:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m using Flows to mimic the Kotlin-native gRPC bidi stream interface: http://go/kotlin/reading/grpc#server-stubs\n\nSo if/when we switch to that codegen, rather than just the Java one, we don\u0027t need to change anything fundamental in the actual server, just the calls to these utility methods.",
      "parentUuid": "1e4b473b_50877628",
      "revId": "7bdb42a6338404631bb9766212a075786c68ebab",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
