      "writtenOn": "2022-09-06T17:15:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A channel can be converted to a flow with [receiveAsFlow](https://kotlinlang.org/api/kotlinx.coroutines/kotlinx-coroutines-core/kotlinx.coroutines.flow/receive-as-flow.html).\n\nI totally agree with the usage of Flow as input and output of `grpcBidirectionalStream`. I\u0027m only suggesting to switch the `MutableSharedFlow` to a `Channel` inside the implementation as a `Channel` have a \"builtin\" support for closing.",
